      "description": "Free download: flaming skull sculpture made from one flat illustration with SupaVoxel - [supavoxel.com](https://supavoxel.com/?utm_source=sketchfab&utm_medium=ugc&utm_campaign=noorhassan99&utm_content=pool108). Image in, textured 3D model out, nothing else touched.\n\nHow it was made: I dropped the reference image into SupaVoxel, waited about two minutes and exported the textured GLB (2K base color + normal + ORM baked in). No retopo, no manual UVs.\n\nDelete the 'supavoxel-badge' node for the clean mesh. Download is free (CC-BY); GLB/OBJ/STL conversions are in the Sketchfab download menu.",
